msgid ""
"AnduinOS disables all system-level telemetry by default.\n"
"We do not collect your usage habits.\n"
"We do not upload your search history.\n"
"There are no pervasive advertisements."
msgstr ""
"AnduinOS menonaktifkan semua telemetri tingkat sistem secara default.\n"
"Kami tidak mengumpulkan kebiasaan penggunaan Anda.\n"
"Kami tidak mengunggah riwayat pencarian Anda.\n"
"Tidak ada iklan yang merajalela."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2290
msgid ""
"In an era ruled by algorithms and surveillance,\n"
"this is our firmest commitment to you."
msgstr ""
"Di era yang dikuasai oleh algoritma dan pengawasan,\n"
"inilah komitmen terkuat kami kepada Anda."

#: assets/anduinos-oobe:2309
msgid "✓ Zero telemetry — your activity is yours alone"
msgstr "✓ Nol telemetri — aktivitas Anda hanya milik Anda sendiri"

